# Microsoft 365 AI Prompts for Women

A collection of AI prompts to help you solve common Microsoft 365 
issues yourself — no specialized IT knowledge is required.

---

## Microsoft Teams

### Messages not loading or Teams running slowly
> "My Microsoft Teams is not showing my messages or is loading 
slowly. What can I check and fix myself before contacting 
IT support?"

---

## Outlook

### Emails stuck in outbox
> "My Outlook emails are not sending or are stuck in my outbox. 
Walk me through how to fix this myself step by step."

---

## OneDrive

### Files not syncing
> "My OneDrive files are not syncing. The icon has a red X or 
yellow warning sign. What does this mean and how do I fix it?"

---

## Microsoft 365 Account

### Can't sign in
> "I can't sign into my Microsoft 365 account. I haven't forgotten 
my password but it keeps saying my credentials are wrong. 
What should I try?"

